     "body": "<p>DuraCloud REST API documentation: <a href=\"https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/DURACLOUDDOC/DuraCloud+REST+API\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/DURACLOUDDOC/DuraCloud+REST+API</a></p>\n\n<p>The specific call that is most relevant here is the store content request: <a href=\"https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/DURACLOUDDOC/DuraCloud+REST+API#DuraCloudRESTAPI-StoreContent\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/DURACLOUDDOC/DuraCloud+REST+API#DuraCloudRESTAPI-StoreContent</a></p>",
