      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>1) An OSGi-compliant DuraCloud-API wrapper, analogous to: <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-camel\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-camel</a> (1 ideal-week work)<br/>\n2) A Camel component that defines routes which bridge updates from F4 into calls to the DuraCloud wrapper, analogous to: <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/tree/master/fcrepo-indexing-triplestore\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-camel-toolbox/tree/master/fcrepo-indexing-triplestore</a> (1 ideal-week work)</p>",
